-- =============================================================================
-- Cost Tracking Schema
-- DEPRECATED: Cost data now lives in activity_execution_traces table
-- =============================================================================
--
-- This file previously defined the activity_costs table which duplicated
-- cost data from metabob-activity-api's activity_execution_traces table.
--
-- As of the Vessel Alignment update:
-- - activity_costs table is NO LONGER USED
-- - Cost queries now directly query activity_execution_traces
-- - This eliminates data sync issues and maintains single source of truth
--
-- See: openspec/changes/vessel-alignment-cost-tracking/proposal.md
-- =============================================================================

-- The activity_costs table definition has been removed.
-- Cost aggregation is now performed by querying activity_execution_traces
-- directly from user-vessel's cost routes (/v2/costs/*).
--
-- Migration Notes:
-- - If activity_costs table exists from previous deployments, it can be dropped
-- - DROP TABLE IF EXISTS activity_costs;
-- - Historical data in activity_costs should be migrated to activity_execution_traces
--   before dropping, or retained for audit purposes.

-- =============================================================================
-- Legacy Table Cleanup (run manually if needed)
-- =============================================================================
-- REMOVE TABLE IF EXISTS activity_costs;
-- REMOVE TABLE IF EXISTS cost_summaries;
